  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative video - a documentary film</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This documentary film and mobile cinema project is primarily aimed at young Sierra Leoneans who are tempted to become illegal immigrant in Western Developed countries e.g UK and America (fantastical paradise called Babylon). Once they arrive in these developed countries, they realised it is not the paradise they dreamed of at all. They struggle to find their feet in a strange land. They often suffer serious psychological trauma, unfulfilled hopes, and dashed dreams and unable to return home. The film will reveal facts about these countries showing the reality of both illegal and legal immigrants. 
The film will be shot in UK and Sierra Leone and distributed and screened in Video Centers around the country. In addition, a  mobile cinema would be used to show this film.</narrative>
  </description>
